    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Leyla Çetin",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117870821940221197422/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUXIHoAw7yTFEDjODM483JctTAuqz7yULx1y5VSird_n9KQJyP0=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 months ago",
        "text": "Best music store! Greatest discovery!!! Not only they have tonnes of various musical instruments, tools, resources, also there is a musical school right there. My son is taking guitar lessons and teachers are all very experienced and so attentive!!\nEvery single person here is kind, friendly and helpful, that indicates it's a great place to work , shop and study!\nGreat job guys, thank you for all your contribution in music!!!",
        "time": 1763481383,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Barbara Linck",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/114409243544570388380/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVdTgztZBceXNtdqXsSTy74Bh94Ib04EEH-9h3KwQk9n0SRGaX-AQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 months ago",
        "text": "I absolutely love this music store!\nThey have a fantastic variety of instruments, and they even offer rentals.\nMy daughter takes music lessons here and absolutely enjoys them. Jeff, the guitar teacher is wonderful, and she loves exploring the store and picking out new instruments.\n\nIt’s always a fun experience, and I highly recommend it!",
        "time": 1763150699,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Anthony Fossey",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/116763051638259927178/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWr-GfYwBMY4KdtMljPGEJDM3Wn01FSoR5JmVbJEUjD7Yba42jf6g=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 years ago",
        "text": "Amazing store! One of the best music stores I've ever been to. The staff are very friendly and by now they probably know me well 😂\n\nI've bought a couple guitars and always go there if I need any supplies or rentals, it's always quicks and easy and not expensive at all. The best place in my opinion is the acoustic room. I went there and they were totally chill with me taking pics for a project, definitely a fun place to go, highly recommend!",
        "time": 1674505690,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "M.J.S.",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/116484281816222563235/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLKHkcitfPq77r7zk7n9ZAgsZsxCfP3zT0fzuWrc9TliOj9oQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "8 months ago",
        "text": "Friendly, patient, and extremely knowledgeable staff.  Came is with an idea what I wanted after shopping around. Brandon helped me through the pros and cons of the models I was looking at and helped me make the right choice.\n\nI would recommend this location for its service and friendly team any day!",
        "time": 1749007191,
        "translated": false
